  "text_pages": [
    "국제교류처\nLOGIN\nABOUT US\nGreetings\nGlobal Profile\nContact Us\nDirections\nAPPLY\nUndergraduate Admission\nGraduate Admission\nKorean Language Programs\nScholarships\nGLOBAL MOBILITY\nInbound\nOutbound\nSTUDENT SERVICES\nSupport Framework\nVisa Services\nDormitory\nInsurance\nCampus Life\nCounseling\nAccessibility\nLANGUAGE EDUCATION\nKorean Language Programs\nForeign Language Programs\nNOTICE\nNotice\nNews & Events\nSEOULTECH\n|\nLOGIN\n학과 메뉴\nABOUT US\nAPPLY\nGLOBAL MOBILITY\nSTUDENT SERVICES\nLANGUAGE EDUCATION\nNOTICE\nGreetings\nGlobal Profile\nContact Us\nDirections\nUndergraduate Admission\nGraduate Admission\nKorean Language Programs\nScholarships\nInbound\nOutbound\nSupport Framework\nVisa Services\nDormitory\nInsurance\nCampus Life\nCounseling\nAccessibility\nKorean Language Programs\nForeign Language Programs\nNotice\nNews & Events\nInbound\nGLOBAL MOBILITY\nABOUT US\nAPPLY\nGLOBAL MOBILITY\nSTUDENT SERVICES\nLANGUAGE EDUCATION\nNOTICE\nInbound\nInbound\nOutbound\nGLOBAL MOBILITY\nInbound\nABOUT US\nAPPLY\nGLOBAL MOBILITY\nSTUDENT SERVICES\nLANGUAGE EDUCATION\nNOTICE\nInbound\nOutbound\nOverview\nCalendar\nCourse\nVisa\nCampus life & Living\nAcademic Credit System\nInbound\n홈\nGLOBAL MOBILITY\nInbound\nOverview\nOverview\nCalendar\nCourse\nVisa\nCampus life & Living\nAcademic Credit System\nSeoulTech offers the following Inbound Programs:\n▶ Student Exchange Program\n:\nStudents can enroll in up to six academic credit courses.\n* The Student Exchange Program at SeoulTech allows students from\npartner universities\nto pursue their studies for one or two semesters at SeoulTech.\n* Students who are officially nominated by their home universities will have the opportunity to apply for the Student Exchange Program at SeoulTech.\n* Tuition will be waived under the student exchange agreement.\n▶\nVisiting(Fee-paying) Program\n:\nStudents can enroll in up to six academic credit courses.\n* Open to students enrolled at\nboth partner and non-partner universities\nof SeoulTech.\n* Participants will have the chance to take credit courses to pursue their studies for one or two semesters at SeoulTech.\n* Students must be officially nominated by their home universities.\n* Although students in the Visiting Program are granted the same status as exchange students, they are not eligible for tuition waivers.\n■\nEligibility\nExchange student who wishes to study at SeoulTech must;\n- Completed at least (Undergraduate) two semesters / (Graduate) one semester at student’s home university\n- Be enrolled as a full-time student at home university that has an active student exchange agreement with SeoulTech\n- Be nominated as an exchange student candidate by student home university\n- Be able to study in either English or Korean for at least one semester (4.5 months)\n- Have not studied at any other Korean university in the previous semester\n■\nStudy Period 2027/2028\n- 2027 Spring\n: March 2, 2027 ~ June 21, 2027\n- 2027 Fall     :\nSeptember 1, 2027 ~\nDecember 21, 2027 (Tentative)\n- 2028 Spring : March 2, 2028 ~ June 21, 2028\n■\nApplication Documents\n- Online application: Application link will be sent to student who have been officially nominated by student home university\n- Certificate of Enrollment (※ original required to SeoulTech)\n- Official Transcript\n(※ original required to SeoulTech)\n- Certificate of Language Proficiency (English or Korean)\n- Study Plan\n- Copy of Valid Passport\n- Photo (Passport-sized: 3.5cm×4.5cm)\nFACTSHEET_2027/2028\nQuick Link\n웹메일\n학생포털\n생활관\n하이코리아\n유학생보험청구\nInstagram\nYoutube\nKakaoTalk\n개인정보처리방침(Privacy Policy)\nSEOUL NATIONAL UNIVERSITY OF SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY\n|\nOffice of International Affairs\nTel : +82-2-970-9206~7 Fax : +82-2-970-9229\nCopyright (c) SEOUL NATIONAL UNIVERSITY OF SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY. All Rights Reserved."
